consent.description:
Before installing Linus Brain, please read the Trust contract: [{contract_site}/en/linus-brain-trust-contract/]({contract_site}/en/linus-brain-trust-contract/) (Version {contract_version}).

In summary, Linus Brain sends the following data to the Linus cloud:
- an installation identifier derived from your Home Assistant `core.uuid`, and the cloud instance associated with it;
- your manual actions on lights (entity_id, area name, states before and after, brightness, color);
- the environmental context (ambient illuminance, sun elevation, time, day);
- the presence and activity of each area;
- activity times (last activity of the instance).

The contract and its deletion procedure only cover the Linus cloud, not a Supabase URL you entered yourself.
